.TH PSI 1 "" "psi" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
psi \- terminal coding agent
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B psi
[\fIoptions\fR] [\fImessage\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
psi is a small terminal coding agent. The host runtime is C89;
the agent loop, providers, and TUI are pure Lua. With no flags,
psi opens the inline TUI over the same runtime that
\fB--print\fR, \fB--agent\fR, and \fB--repl\fR drive.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-agent\fR \fITEXT\fR
run a single Anthropic\-backed coding\-agent turn
.TP
\fB\-\-boot\fR \fIFILE\fR
override the Lua bootstrap file
.TP
\fB\-\-chat\fR
use the chat\-style TUI (transcript flows into terminal scrollback)
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR \fIN\fR
compact the current session, keeping the most recent N messages
.TP
\fB-c\fR, \fB\-\-continue\fR
continue the most recent session for the current directory
.TP
\fB\-\-eval\fR \fIEXPR\fR
evaluate a Lua expression and print the result
.TP
\fB-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
show help
.TP
\fB\-\-max-tokens\fR \fIN\fR
max output tokens for \-\-agent
.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fIMODEL\fR
model to use with \-\-agent
.TP
\fB\-\-no-context-files\fR
disable AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md discovery (alias \-nc)
.TP
\fB\-\-no-extensions\fR
disable user extension discovery
.TP
\fB\-\-no-prompt-templates\fR
disable prompt template discovery (alias \-np)
.TP
\fB\-\-print\fR \fITEXT\fR
run the bootstrap print\-mode handler
.TP
\fB\-\-prompt-template\fR \fIFILE\fR
load an extra prompt template file or directory
.TP
\fB\-\-repl\fR
run the interactive line editor shell
.TP
\fB-r\fR, \fB\-\-resume\fR
pick a session to resume (TUI picker)
.TP
\fB\-\-session\fR \fIFILE\fR
load and save a JSONL session file
.TP
\fB\-\-system-prompt\fR
print the default coding\-agent system prompt
.TP
\fB\-\-thinking\fR \fILEVEL\fR
thinking level: off, minimal, low, medium, high, xhigh
.TP
\fB\-\-tui\fR
run the inline interactive TUI
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
show version
